# Task 02: S3-Triggered Lambda Update with CodeBuild

## Task description
## Architecture
CI/CD Pipeline Architecture
The pipeline works as follows:

Developer uploads updated Lambda code to S3 bucket Look into default Lambda code ${LambdaFunctionName} and when you will create your local files put this changes into index.py: "body": "Hello from Lambda, updated version!"
S3 Event Notification triggers a Lambda function
Lambda function starts a CodeBuild project
AWS SDK Documentation for triggering CodeBuild:

Python (Boto3) SDK - start_build
JavaScript (AWS SDK v3) - StartBuildCommand
Don't forget to add boto3 into requirements.txt 4. CodeBuild downloads source from S3, builds the package, and updates Lambda function

