## Important: Understanding CodeBuild

CodeBuild is the core of this pipeline. It:
Runs in a managed Docker container environment
Executes commands defined in buildspec.yaml
Has access to AWS SDK through IAM role
Provides build logs in CloudWatch Logs
Can update AWS resources (in this case, Lambda function)
Learn more about CodeBuild Build Environment

## Task Resources
Before starting, you will have from CloudFormation:

S3 bucket: ${bucket_name}
Lambda function (hello-world): ${LambdaFunctionName}
IAM role for hello-world Lambda: ${iam_role_lambda_cf}
You will create manually:

Lambda trigger function: ${LambdaFunctionTrigger}
IAM role for CodeBuild: ${iam_role_cb}
S3 Event Notification: ${event_notification_name}
CodeBuild project: ${codebuild_project}
## Objectives

## Prepare Code: Create index.py, requirements.txt, buildspec.yaml and package as build.zip

## Configure Lambda Trigger: Create Lambda function ${LambdaFunctionTrigger} that invokes CodeBuild start-build API, assign role ${iam_role_lambda_cf}. Important: Set timeout to 10 seconds (default 3 seconds is too short and will cause multiple retries)
Setup S3 Events: Configure S3 Event Notification ${event_notification_name} on bucket ${bucket_name} to trigger ${LambdaFunctionTrigger} on object creation
Create IAM Role: Manually create IAM role ${iam_role_cb} for CodeBuild with S3 read and Lambda update permissions
Create CodeBuild Project: Configure project ${codebuild_project} with S3 source from ${bucket_name}, buildspec from artifact, and IAM role ${iam_role_cb}
Test Pipeline: Upload build.zip to ${bucket_name} and verify end-to-end execution
## Verification
To verify that you have successfully completed the task:

Ensure S3 bucket is created with Event Notifications enabled.
Ensure Lambda trigger function is created and deployed.
Ensure CodeBuild project is created with proper IAM role and buildspec configuration.
Upload build.zip to S3 and verify CodeBuild build starts automatically.
Verify Lambda function code is updated after CodeBuild completion.
Check CloudWatch Logs for CodeBuild build output and any errors.
